graph TB
    subgraph Operator["mcp-lifecycle-operator-controller-manager"]
        direction TB
        MCPServerReconciler["MCPServerReconciler<br/>(Controller)"]
        HTTPRouteReconciler["MCPGatewayBinding<br/>httproute Reconciler"]
        KuadrantReconciler["MCPGatewayBinding<br/>kuadrant Reconciler"]
        LogLevelController["ConfigMap log-level<br/>Controller"]
        Validator["MCPServerCustomValidator<br/>(Validating Webhook)"]
        ConversionWebhook["MCPServer Conversion<br/>Webhook (v1alpha1/v1beta1)"]
    end

    User[User / kubectl] -->|creates/updates| MCPServerCR["MCPServer CR<br/>(mcp.x-k8s.io)"]
    MCPServerCR -->|watched by| MCPServerReconciler

    MCPServerReconciler -->|creates| Deployment[Deployment<br/>MCP Server Pod]
    MCPServerReconciler -->|creates| Service[ClusterIP Service]
    MCPServerReconciler -->|creates| NetworkPolicy[NetworkPolicy<br/>open / restricted]
    MCPServerReconciler -->|creates| MCPGatewayBindingCR["MCPGatewayBinding CR"]
    MCPServerReconciler -->|MCP handshake| Deployment

    MCPGatewayBindingCR -->|watched by| HTTPRouteReconciler
    MCPGatewayBindingCR -->|watched by| KuadrantReconciler

    HTTPRouteReconciler -->|creates| HTTPRoute[HTTPRoute]
    KuadrantReconciler -->|creates| MCPServerReg["MCPServerRegistration"]

    HTTPRoute -->|routes to| Gateway["Gateway API<br/>Gateway"]
    MCPServerReg -->|registers with| Kuadrant["Kuadrant API<br/>Management"]

    Validator -->|validates| MCPServerCR
    ConversionWebhook -->|converts| MCPServerCR

    CertManager["cert-manager"] -->|provisions TLS| Operator

    style MCPServerReconciler fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style HTTPRouteReconciler fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style KuadrantReconciler fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style LogLevelController fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style Validator fill:#9b59b6,color:#fff
    style ConversionWebhook fill:#9b59b6,color:#fff
    style MCPServerCR fill:#f5a623,color:#000
    style MCPGatewayBindingCR fill:#f5a623,color:#000
    style Deployment fill:#7ed321,color:#000
    style Service fill:#7ed321,color:#000
    style NetworkPolicy fill:#7ed321,color:#000
    style HTTPRoute fill:#7ed321,color:#000
    style MCPServerReg fill:#7ed321,color:#000
    style Gateway fill:#e8e8e8,color:#000
    style Kuadrant fill:#e8e8e8,color:#000
    style CertManager fill:#e8e8e8,color:#000
